<item><title>Somalia leaves transport minister’s armed confrontation unanswered</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-leaves-transport-minister-s-armed-confrontation-bfb6df/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-leaves-transport-minister-s-armed-confrontation-bfb6df/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>A video showed State Minister Abdikarim Abdow Hayder carrying an AK-47 to the ministry gates amid a dispute over vehicle number-plate kickbacks.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:15:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" length="32841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
